title: Authorizations › Denied › Step-down plans from accepted denials
route: /authorizations?view=denied
intro: When the clinic accepts a denial in Denial Intelligence, the denial's row in Authorizations becomes its step-down plan: status 'Accepted', the next action 'Plan the step-down', and one button that opens the case. It stays in Denied and counts in Needs attention. Separately, two cases carry a 'Consider a step-down' note, a prompt and never a decision.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: Reset demo data clears the accepted denials. Case Manager's folded 'Step-down plans' row and its 'Ready to step down?' card are gone; the row and the note carry them. Denial Intelligence's toast still says 'Case Manager has a step-down plan'.
---
start s1 "Denial Intelligence › a denial › 'Accept the decision' › 'Accept and close'"
store st1 "The accepted denial is recorded\nWhich denial (e.g. D-3297), its request's case, the payer and the demo-clock time"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Accept the denial"
click c0 "On the denial: click 'Plan the step-down'\nor the notification 'Denial closed'"
process p0 "Go to /authorizations?view=all"
start s2 "Open Authorizations › Denied, or Needs attention"

decision d1 "Is the denial a row in the list?\n(by its denial ID or its request's case ID)"
process n1 "Nothing changes in Authorizations"
process p1 "The row stays in Denied (Denied 8 at the start, still 8)\nIt keeps its site: a denial added from a letter follows its own"
screen r1 "The row\nStatus 'Accepted' (grey); its other chips go\nNext action 'Plan the step-down: choose the next level of care and book the first visit.'\nButton 'Open case' (green)"
process r2 "Deadline\nA tracked denial (D-3318) reads 'Step-down plan open'\nA denial only the Dashboard has reads 'None'"
process r3 "It counts in Needs attention; only Reset demo data clears it\nThe status filter 'Accepted' finds it"
click c1 "Click 'Open case' or the ID"
process p2 "Go to /authorizations/case/ and the case of the denial's request\n(D-3297 opens I-2141)"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in"
process p3 "The case page reads 'Accepted. Nothing left to send'"

group gN "'Consider a step-down' notes"
  screen n2 "Under the patient on R-0873 and P-1522: 'Consider a step-down'"
  click n3 "Hover the note"
  process n4 "'Consider a step-down: Day 18 of 21 · aftercare visit not booked yet'\nor 'Day 11 · IOP starts Monday'"
endgroup

store st2 "'Reset demo data' clears the accepted denials"
end e1 "The plan is on the denial's own row"

s1 --> st1 --> g1
st1 --> c0 --> p0 --> d1
s2 --> d1
d1 -->|No| n1
d1 -->|Yes| p1 --> r1 --> r2
r1 --> r3
r1 --> c1 --> p2 --> g2
p2 -.-> p3
r2 --> e1
s2 -.-> n2 --> n3 --> n4
st1 -.-> st2
